OL,3,GNEWSAWhat next for Suffolk village that
OL,4,Avoted to leave UK over migrant plans?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarnham has followed Piddington in
OL,7,Fbecoming the second English village to
OL,8,Fvote to leave the UK in a "symbolic"
OL,9,Fprotest against plans to house hundreds
OL,10,Fof migrants nearby.
OL,12,FHelen Beck, from the Barnham Residents
OL,13,FAssociation, admits it was purely a
OL,14,Fpublicity stunt to "draw attention to
OL,15,Fthe situation", but said "serious work"
OL,16,Fwould now follow.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
