OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWhat next for Suffolk village that
OL,4,Avoted to leave UK over migrant plans?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to house about 930 men at the
OL,7,Fformer military site RAF Barnham on the
OL,8,FSuffolk/Norfolk border near Thetford
OL,9,Fwere proposed, after the government
OL,10,Fvowed to move asylum seekers out of
OL,11,Fhotels.
OL,13,FThe Home Office previously said: "The
OL,14,Fgovernment is working on a fairer
OL,15,Fdistribution of asylum accommodation
OL,16,Facross the country, with over #1bn
OL,17,Fsaved in costs since the election."
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
